# Run artifacts. `python -m src.examples.spt70 <steps> <folder>` writes a whole
# folder; the legacy scripts drop PNGs wherever they are started. None of it is
# source — regenerate it instead of committing it. (The propellant and wall
# tables under materials/ are source and stay tracked; nothing here hides them.)
*.png
*.log
/out/
/maps/
/run_*/
# archived run folders (runs_YYYY-MM-DD/), same reasoning
/runs_*/
